<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="EST" style="id">Esther</book>
  <para style="h">Esther</para>
  <para style="toc1">Esther</para>
  <para style="toc2">Esther</para>
  <para style="mt">Esther</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tami lai-a kigiel thupieng teng pen India gam pan Ethiopia gam dong, gamkhen zakhat sawmni le sagi a uh Ahasuerus’ hun lai-a pieng thu ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Khum hun lai-in kumpi khuo ahi Susa khuopi sunga kumpi topha tungah Kumpipa Ahasuerus a to laitah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />ama a maan a kum thumna kumin a milien zosie le a nasemte adingin ankuong luina khat a siem hi. Persia le Media galkapmangte, mithupite le gamkhen uhte a om laitahin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />a kumpi gam hauna, a thupinate, le a lietnate ni tampi sung, ni za le sawmgiet sung tah a lah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tami nite a tawp ciengin kumpipa in kumpi khuo Susa khuopi sunga om milien mineu zosie adingin kumpi huong sungah ni sagi sung ankuong luina khat a siem hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua huong sungah suongkang khuomte kiphut a, khau malneu le khau dupsan tawh ngun kuolte ah kikhi-in a kikhai dalna puonkangte kihlungin, suong manpha a san, a dum, a kang, le a vom, a nam tuomtuomte kizang a, a kizem suongpha tungah kham le ngun tawh kibawl lupnate kikoi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kham hai nam tuomtuom tawh dawn dingte kihawm a, kumpipa’ hauna dung zui-in zucia dei zaza-in kizang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Zu pen hai golpi tawh kidawn ahi a, kiha tulh ci bang om lo hi; azieh pen mi zosie in amau’ du za beh a dawnsah nading uh kumpipa in kumpi inn sunga vaihawm miliente thu a piehsa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua banah Kumpinu Vashti in zong numeite adingin Kumpipa Ahasuerus’ innsung ma-ah ankuong luina khat a siem hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A ni sagi ni-in zu dawnin a lungnop ciengin kumpipa in ama’ na a sem numete a uh cilgesa pasal sagite ahi Mehuman, Biztha, Harbona, Bigtha, Abagtha, Zethar, le Carkas-te thupie a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />mite le miliente mai-ah a melhoina a lah thei nadingin a kumpi lukhu khusa-in ama kungah Kumpinu Vashti a peipi nadingin amate a sawl hi; azieh pen tua nu a mel hoi a, vel nuomnuom huoi vawt khat ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ahi vangin Kumpinu Vashti in numeite a uh cilgesa pasalte’ thupuoh ahi kumpipa hlatna nielin a pei nuom sih hi. Tam thu-ah kumpipa thangpai-in a sin a so hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua ciengin kumpipa in upadi siem mipilte thu dong hi. (azieh pen upadi le ngaina lam thutheite thudawh pen kumpipa’ zah ngai dan ahi hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />tuale ama’ zoma a to mite ahile Persia le Media gam milien sagite ahi Carshena, Shethar, Admatha, Tarshish, Meres, Marsena, le Memucan-te ahi vua, amate pen kumpipa kunga a haw thei, kumpi gam sunga a to ulien masa pente ahi uhi):
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Numei uh cilgesa pasalte tungtawnin Kumpipa Ahasuerus’ thupieh bangin Kumpinu Vashti gamta lo ahi ziehin upadi tawh kituohin bang kilaw ding ahei?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua ciengin Memucan in kumpipa le miliente mai-ah, “Kumpinu Vashti pen Kumpipa tung beha khiel ahi khop sih a, Kumpipa Ahasuerus’ gamkhen zosie sunga a teng mi zosie tunga zong a khiel ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Bang ding ahei cile tami Kumpinu gamtatna pen numei zosie in ang thei ding vua, a pasalte uh simmawna-in hing nei-in amate in, ‘Kumpi Ahasuerus in ama kunga haw dingin Kumpinu Vashti thuta a, ama a pei sih hi,’ ang ci ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Kumpinu gamtatna a za Persia le Media gam numei thupite in tuni mama-in zong kumpipa nei-a uliente ang ledo ding vua, lungthahna le kisimmawna a veng nawn sih ding hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Kumpipa in hoi na sah leh, kumpi thupiehna khat peisah inlen, Kumpipa Ahasuerus mai-ah Vashti ang peikia ngai nawn lo nading, Persia-te le Media-te’ upadi sungah a kikhel thei nawn lo dingin gielsah in; tuale kumpipa in ama sanga a kilawm zaw numei dang khat in tua nu’ kumpinu hina za luosah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuaci’n kumpipa’ bawl thukhenna kumpi gam muncin tengah a kizah ciengin numei zosie in a neu a lien a kibangin a pasal ciet uh ang zatah ta ding uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Kumpipa le milien teng in tam ngaisutna pen hoi a sa pai vua, Memucan’ gen bangin kumpipa in a bawl hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />ama in pasal zosie ama’ innsung uhpa ahi thei nading le ama’ minam ham a kizui kim thei nadingin, kumpipa’ uhna gamkhen zosie-ah amau’ lai ciet le, mi zosie tungah amau’ ham cietin laihlahte kigiel hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tam thu teng a pien zaw, Kumpipa Ahasuerus’ lungthahna a ven ciengin ama in Vashti phawhin, tua nu gamtatna le ama tunga a thukhennate a phawhkia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama a cing kumpipa’ nasemte in, “Kumpipa adingin ngahnu melhoi khangdawngte suisah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kumpi khuo ahi Susa khuopi-a numeite’ inn ah a melhoi ngahnu khangdawng zosie a khawm dingin kumpi gamkhen zosie-ah uliente koi in. Numeite a uh kumpipa’ cilgesa pasal Hegai in numeite cingsah in; a melhoi theithei nadingun amate kizemsah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuale kumpipa a lungkimsah numei khu Vashti tangin kumpinu suoh heh,” a ci uhi. Kumpipa in tam thu pen pha a sa a, ama in tua bangin a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua laitahin kumpi khuo Susa ah Benjamin-te Kish, a tapa Shimei, a tapa Jair, a tapa Mordecai a kici Jew-te khat a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kish pen Babylon Kumpipa Nebuchadnezzar in Jerusalem panin Judah Kumpipa Jeconiah tawh sala a matte lahah a kihal khat ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mordecai in a pano’ tanu Hadassah, Esther a kici mi khat kem hi, azieh pen ama in nu le a pa nei lo hi; tua numei nu a melhoi le a duongcing khat ahi a, a nu le a pa a si ciengin Mordecai in ama’ tanu dinga a kep ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuaci’n kumpipa’ thupiehna le a thusuo a kizah ciengin kumpi khuo Susa-a Hegai kici pa’ kep dingin ngahnu tampite a kipeipi ciengin, Esther zong kumpi inn sunga numeite a cingpa Hegai kungah kizawpi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua numei in ama’ lunglam sukha a, a maipha a nga ziehin a kisiemna dingte le a an satanh a nawpieh pai a, kumpipa’ inn sung panin a kituomteel nasem numei sagi zong guonin, ama le a nasem numeite tungah numeite’ inn a hoipen mun a pie pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Esther in a mite tungah hile, a sanggamte tungah hile a theisah sih hi, azieh pen Mordecai in a gen vawt lo dingin ama thupie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Esther bangci op a, ama in bang thu teng a tuoh diei ci thei nuomin numeite’ inn leituol ah nisielin Mordecai a vah kawikawi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Numeite’ kisiem dan ding ngainate a om bangin hla sawm le ni a cin zaw ciengin Kumpi Ahasuerus kungah a banbanin numei zosie a kilah ding hun a tung hi. Amau’ kisiem dan tam bang ahi hi: Sathau le Myrrh panamtui tawh hla guh sung kipuo-in, panamtui tuomtuomte le kipuona dangte tawh hla guh sung ma kipuokia uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Kumpipa kungah numeite a pei ciengun numeite’ inn pan kumpipa’ inn ah amau’ dei popo kikengsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nitah lamin tua nu pei a, zingmawng ciengin a nina numeite’ inn ah a kilekia phot vua, kumpipa’ numeite a uh cilgesa ameite a cing pasal Shaashgaz in amate kem hi. Kumpipa’ lunglam a suhkhah sih a, a min tawh a kihlatkia sih leh tua nu pen kumpipa kungah peikia nawn lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mordecai in a tanu dinga a kep a pano Abihail’ tanu Esther hun tung a, kumpipa kungah a pei ciengin ama in numeite a cingpa, kumpipa’ numeite a uh cilgesa pasal Hegai’ gen teng simlo bangma a ngetbe sih hi. Tu-in ama a mu zosie in Esther a pahta ciet uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ama in a uh zaw a kum sagina a hla sawmna ahi Tebeth hla sungin kumpi’ inn sunga Kumpi Ahasuerus kungah Esther a kipeipi ciengin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />numei dangte zosie sangin kumpipa in Esther a itzaw hi; ama in ngahnu zosie sangin a maipha le lunglutna nga kha a, ama in tua nu lutungah kumpi lukhu khusah a, Vashti tangin kumpinu a suohsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tua ciengin kumpipa in a uliente le a vaihawmpite adingin “Esther Pawi” a kici pawi thupi khat a bawlpieh hi. Ama in a gamkhen teng tungah zong zumkhah ni khat pie a, kumpipa’ min tawh a kilawm a kituoh letsongte zong a hawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ngahnu siengthote a kisuhtuo ciengun kumpipa’ tunkotah Mordecai a to hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tu-in Mordecai in a hilsa bangin Esther in a sanggamte tungah hile, a minamte tungah hile pulah lo hi; azieh pen ama in a kep lai-in ama’ thu a man ma bangin tu-in zong Mordecai’ thu a mang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Kumpipa’ tunkotah Mordecai a to laitahin, kumpipa’ lupna tunkotcing Bigthan le Teresh a kici kumpipa’ numeite a uh cilgesa pasal nite lungthahin Kumpi Ahasuerus tha a sawm uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ahi vangin Mordecai in tua thu thei-in Kumpinu Esther kungah gen a, tuale Esther in Mordecai’ min tawh kumpipa kungah a gen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A thu kikanin a kigen bangma ahi hi, ci-in a kithei ciengin ama gel sing tungah a kikhailia hi. Tami thupieng teng kumpipa muna-ah Kumpi Gam Tangthu Laibu sungah kiciemte hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tam thu teng zaw ciengin Kumpi Ahasuerus in Agag-te Hammedatha’ tapa Haman a za khangsah a, a naseppi miliente zosie sangin a lienzaw-in a koi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuale kumpipa’ tunkota a suoh kha kumpipa’ nasemte zosie in Haman zatah bawlin a mai-ah a kun vangiam uhi; azieh pen ama tam banga kibawl ding ahi hi, ci-in kumpipa in thu a piehsa ahi hi. Hizongle ama’ mai-ah Mordecai kun loin zatahna zong pie lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua ciengin kumpipa’ tunkota om kumpipa’ nasemte in Mordecai kungah, “Bang dinga kumpipa’ thupieh mang lo na hei?” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amate in ni khat zaw ni khat ama kungah a gen vua, ama in amau’ thugen a man nop lo ciengin, Mordecai’ thugente a kimang ding ma ahi amah ci a thei nadingun Haman kungah a khie uhi; bangzieh ahei cile ama pen Jew-te a hina thu amate kungah a gen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ama mai-ah Mordecai kun loin zatahna a pieh lo lam a mu ciengin Haman thangpai mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hinanle ama in Mordecai khat guoh tunga a khut hlan ding pen bawltah a sa sih a, tuaci’n ama kungah Mordecai’ mite a kigenna bangin, Haman in Ahasuerus’ kumpi gam sung muncin tenga a om Mordecai’ mite ahi Jew zosie suhsiet a sawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kumpi Ahasuerus’ uh a kum sawm le nina, a hla masa pen ahi Nisan hla panin a ni ni, a hla hla-in Pur a kici aisanna tawh Haman mai-ah ai kisan a, a hla sawm le nina Adar hla a ni sawm le thum ni-in a aisan a pha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua ciengin Haman in Kumpipa Ahasuerus kungah, “Nangma’ kumpi gam sung gamkhen tenga mite lahah kithezahin a tuom om mi pawlkhat a om hi; amahaw’ ngainate pen adang mi zosie-a’ tawh kibang lo a, kumpipa’ thukhamte a zui sih uhi, tuaci’n kumpipa in bangma law loin amate na hici tanghla ding kilawm lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kumpipa in hoi na sah leh, amate a kisuhsiet nadingin thukhenna bawl inlen, kumpipa’ sumkholna sunga koi dingin kumpipa’ nasepna vaisaite khut sungah ngun talent tul sawm ka pie ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuaci’n kumpipa in ama’ khuta om a suoikaina khutsip a sutdawh a, Jew-te’ gal ahi Agag-te Hammedatha’ tapa Haman a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kumpipa in Haman kungah, “Na sum gente le na mi gente zong nangma tungah ang kipie zo a, na dei bangin amate tungah kibawl ta’n,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua ciengin a hla masa a ni sawm le thum ni-in kumpipa’ thuvanpite zosie kihlan a, tuale Haman’ thupieh zosie tawh kizui-in kumpipa vaisaite, gamkhen zosie a uhte, minam zosie lahah miliente tungah lai kigiel hi, gamkhen zosie-ah amau’ lai ciet, mi zosie tungah amau’ ham cietin kigiel hi; kumpi Ahasuerus’ min tawh tami lai kigiel a, kumpipa’ khutsip tawh kitum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Kumpi gamkhente zosie-ah laitaite lai kipiesah a, a hla sawm le nina, a ni sawm le thum ni, ni khat sungin Jew-te zosie a teh a khang, numei naupang susie-in thatin a suhmang nading ule amau’ neisa teng a tomgam nadingun thu kipie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Khum ni-in mi zosie a baisa-in a op nadingun a kiteisawn thukhenna laidal khat ciet gamkhen mun zosie-ah kipuohin a kizasah kim ding ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Kumpipa’ thupiehna tawh a mallangin laitaite pei-in kumpi khuopi Susa panin thukhenna lai kihawm hi. Kumpipa le Haman zu dawnin a toton uhi; ahi vangin Susa khuopi sung a buoi mama hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mordecai in tam thu kibawl teng zosie a thei ciengin a puon botkehin la-ip puon silin vut kibuoh a, nahpitahin a kaa kawmin khuo sungah a vah kawikawi hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />kumpipa’ tunkotah ama peito hi, azieh pen kumpipa tunkot ah la-ip puon silte koima khat beh kilutsah lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kumpipa’ thupiehna le a thukhenna a tunna gamkhen zosie-a Jew-te lahah dana le kaana nasietahin omin, antangin kap le mau-in a om vua, a tamzawte in la-ip puon silin vut lahah a lum uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Esther’ nasem numeite le numeite a uh cilgesa pasalte pei-in ama kungah a gen ciengun, kumpinu a da mama hi; ala-ip puon a sut nadingin ama in Mordecai adingin puonsilte a hlah hi; hinanle ama in tuate sang lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua ciengin Esther in kumpipa’ numeite a uh cilgesa pasalte lahah ama cing dinga kise ahi Hathach hlan a, bang zieha tam thu teng pieng ahei, ci Mordecai kunga kan dingin a sawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kumpipa’ tunkot mai khuopi tuolzanga om Mordecai kungah Hathach pei a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />tuale Mordecai in ama tunga a pieng thu zosie le Jew-te a kitha nadingin Haman in kumpipa’ sumkholna-ah pieh dinga a sum ciemza thu zosie ama kungah a gen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mordecai in zong amate suhsiet nading Susa khuopi-a kihawm thukhenna lai a kiteisawn khat ama pie a, ama in tua lai Esther lahin a thu a na gencien nading le, ama nu zong kumpipa kungah na pei pai a, a mite adingin ama kunga a va thumpieh dingin a sawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hathach pei-in Esther kungah Mordecai’ thugen teng a gen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tua ciengin Esther in Hathach hopi-in Mordecai tungah thu zasah a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Kumpipa’ nasemte le kumpipa gamkhen sunga mite zosie in numei hile, pasal hile, hlat lopi-in kumpipa’ opna inn sungah a va mawh lut leh upadi khat beh om a, tua khu mi zosie a kibanga tha ding ahi hi. Kumpipa in a kham ciengkhut ama langah a na le leh beh tua mipa suohta ding a hina thu a theisa uh ahi hi. Keimama zong kumpipa kunga haw dinga ei kihlat lo zaw ni sawmthum bang pha ta hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mordecai kungah Esther’ thugen teng a gen ciengun,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mordecai in amate kungah Esther a thuhkiana gen a, “Kumpipa’ inn sunga na op mawh vangin adang Jew-te zosie a kitha leh nang a suohta tuon dingin kingaisun sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile tam bang hunin bangma gen loin na sip dide leh mundang khat panin Jew-te’ noptuom nading le hutkhiet na ding thu ang pieng veve ding a, ahi vangin nang le na pa’ innkuonte na si ding uhi. Tam bang hun ding ma-a kumpinu suoh na hi mel zong koi in thei ahei?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua ciengin Esther in amate kungah Mordecai a dawnna gen a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Pei inlen, Susa khuopi-a Jew-te na mu zosie khawmin, kei tangin an na tang unlen, ni thum sung an ne lo tui dawn loin sun le zanin na om un. Keima le ka nasemte in note’ tan bangin ka na tang ding uhi. Tua zaw ciengin upadi tawh kituoh sih nanleh kumpipa kungah ka va haw ta ding hi; ka si le zong a si ka hi mai ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua ciengin Mordecai pei-in Esther’ sawl bangin na zosie a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />A ni thum ni-in a kumpi puon tawh Esther kisiemin, kumpipa’ kikhopna innkhan tawh a kigalsai kumpi’ inn leituol sung lamah a ding hi. Kumpi inn lutna tawh a kigalsai kumpi’ inn sunga kumpi topha tungah kumpipa a to hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kumpipa in inntuola a ding Kumpinu Esther a mu behin tua nu in ama’ maipha nga a, Esther lamah a khuta a tawi a kham ciengkhut a zah phei hi. Tua bepin Esther in ama nai a, kumpipa ciengkhut dawn a tham hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kumpipa in tua nu kungah, “Kumpinu Esther aw, bang thu ahei? Na nget nop bang pen ahei? Nang tungah kumpi gam a phalkhat cieng nangawn ang kipie ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua ciengin Esther in, “Kumpipa na lung lam ahile, kumpipa dinga ka bawl ka ankuonglui ne dingin tuni-in Haman tawh hing pei ta un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua ciengin kumpipa in, “Eite in Esther’ dei banga i sep thei nadingin mallangin Haman vah lan ta un,” a ci hi. Tuaci’n Esther’ siemsa ankuong im dingin kumpipa le Haman a pei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Amate in zu a neh laitahun kumpipa in Esther kungah, “Na nget nop bang ahei? Ang kipie ding hi. Bang ahei na thum ding? Ka gam phalkhat cieng dong nangawn ang kipie ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua bepin Esther in, “Nang tunga kang nget nop le kang thum nop pen tami ahi hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Keima in kumpipa’ maipha ka nga a, kumpipa in ka ngetna le ka thumnate nei pieh nuom dinga ahile, keima in noma gel dinga ka bawl ka ankuonglui ne dingin zing ciengin kumpipa le Haman hing pei un. Tua ciengin keima in kumpipa’ gen bangin kang dawng ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Khum ni-in Haman lungdam kipahin a pei hi. Ahi vangin kumpi tunkot gei-a om Modecai in a mai-ah na ding beh lo a, zatahna lim a na lah lo a mu ciengin, Mordecai tungah ama lungthah mama hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />hizongle ama le ama ki-ip kenkonin inn-ah Haman a pei hi. Tua ciengin a guolte le a zi Zeresh hlan a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />a hauna thupi dante, a tapa nei teng, kumpipa in pahta-in a za a khansahna teng, kumpipa’ uliente le vaihawmte sangin a lienzaw-in ama a koina thu zosie amate kungah a gen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Haman in genbe lai a, “Kumpinu Esther nangawn in a bawlsa ankuong luina-ah kumpipa tawh ankuong im dingin kei ci simlo midang koima peisah lo hi. Zing ciengin zong kumpipa tawh ankuong imton dingin ama in ei hlan lai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ahi vangin kumpipa’ tunkot ah a to Jew-te Mordecai ka mu laisie tam teng zosie a mawhna suoh zel hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua ciengin a zi Zeresh le a guolte zosie in ama kungah, “Tong sawmnga a sang khuom phutsah inlen, tua tungah Modecai a kikhailia nadingin zing ciengin kumpipa kungah gen in; tua ciengin ankuong im dingin kumpipa tawh lung nuomtahin pei in,” a ci uhi. Haman in tam thu hoi sa a, tuaci’n a gui-awh nading khuom ama a phutsah hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuami zanin kumpipa kimu thei lo a, thupieng teng ciemtena laibu lasahin a mai-ah tuate kisim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tua banga a kisim ciengin, kotcing, kumpipa’ numeite a uh cilgesa pasal Bigthan le Teresh in kumpipa Ahasuerus tha a sawmdapna uh Mordecai in a genkhiet, thu ciemtena sunga kigiel kimu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua ciengin kumpipa in, “Tami thu ziehin Mordecai tungah patawina ahi sihle minphatna bang a kipie zo ta ahei?” a ci hi. Ama a cing kumpipa’ nasemte in, “Ama ading bangma khat beh kibawlpieh lo hi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kumpipa in, “Inn tuolah koi a om ei?” a ci hi. Tua laitahin Haman in Mordecai khailia nadinga a bawl khuom tungah ama a kikhailia nading thu a gen dingin kumpipa’ inntuol pulamah a lut hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuaci’n kumpipa’ nasemte in ama kungah, “Khum sungah Haman om hi; inn tuolah ding hi,” a ci uhi. Kumpipa in, “Ama hing lutsah un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuaci’n Haman lut a, kumpipa in ama kungah, “Kumpipa in a patawi nuom mipa tungah bang kibawlpieh leh hoi na sa ei?” a ci hi. Haman in a lungsim sungah ngaisun a, “Kumpipa in keima kana a patawi nop zawh ding koi om tuon ding ahei?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuaci’n Haman in kumpipa kungah, “Kumpipa in na patawi nop mipa adingin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />kumpipa’ silsa ahi kumpi puonte, kumpipa tuonna sakol a kumpi lukhu tawh lasah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kumpipa’ milien pen khat kungah tua kumpi puonte le sakol piesah in; ama in kumpipa patawi nop mipa kumpi puon silsah hinlen, ama in sakol tungah tua mipa tuongsahin khuopi gawlzing lampi tengah kaisah kawikawi inlen, ama mai-ah, ‘Kumpipa’ patawi nop mipa tungah tam bangin kibawl ding hi,’ ci-in tangtawhsah in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tua ciengin kumpipa in Haman kungah, “Na gensa bangin mallangin kumpi’ puonte le sakol va la ta’nlen, kumpipa’ tunkota a to Mordecai tungah va bawl ta’n. Na gensa khat beh hen nei sin,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuaci’n Haman in kumpi puonte le sakol la-in Mordecai silsah a, khuopi gawlzing lampi tengah tuongsahin, “Kumpipa in a patawi nop mipa tungah tam bangin kibawl ding hi,” ci-in tang a tawh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua ciengin kumpipa’ tunkotah Mordecai peikia a, ahi vangin Haman ahile puon kilukhu-in a kaa pumin a inn ah a nawpei ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Haman in ama tunga thupieng teng zosie a zi Zeresh le a guolte kungah a gen ciengin, a zi Zeresh le a thumop mite in ama kungah, “Na lel ngai pa Mordecai khu Jew-te ahi poma leh ama na zo sih ding a, ama’ masangah a pua valon ding na hi hi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Amate a kiho laitahun kumpipa’ numeite a uh cilgesa pasalte a tung vua, Esther ankuong luina-a pei dingin Haman a naw zawpi uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuaci’n Kumpinu Esther tawh ankuong im dingin kumpipa le Haman a pei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A ni ni ni, amate in zu a dawn laitahun kumpipa in Esther kungah, “Kumpinu Esther aw, na thum nop pen bang ahei? Ang kipie ding hi. Na nget nop pen bang ahei? Ka gam phalkhat cieng nangawn ang kipie ding hi,” a cikia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua ciengin Esther in dawng a, “Kumpipa aw, keima in na maipha nga-in, tuami in kumpipa ang lungkimsah leh, keima ei hingkhawi in - tua khu kang thum nop pen ahi a - ka mite zong hing hingkhawi in- tua khu kang nget nop pen ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile keima le ka mite suhsiet ding, thagam ding, le suhmaimang dinga ei kizua ahi ta hi. Ko numei le pasal teng pen sal maimai dinga ei kizua ding hi leh bangma ka gen sih ding hi; ahi vangin koima galte in kumpipa tunga a tung tami sietna a lokia zo sih ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua ciengin Kumpipa Ahasuerus in Kumpinu Esther kungah, “Tami a bawl ngam ding koi hi a, ama hei sunga om ahei?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Esther in, “Keima ei langpang le ka galpa ahi tami migilo Haman a khu!” a ci hi. Tua ciengin kumpipa le kumpinu mai-ah Haman zau-in a citun hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A lungthah sengin ankuong panin kumpipa dingdawh a, kumpi um sungah a vah kawikawi hi, hizongle kumpinu tungah a suohta nading ngenin Haman a om den hi, azieh pen ama in kumpipa in ama suhsiet a sawm lam a thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kumpite’ um panin a ankuong imna innpi-ah a kilekia ciengin, kumpipa in Esther kingapna topha tunga a pua Haman a mu hi. Tuale kumpipa in, “Ka inn sung ka muna nangawnah tam mipa in kumpinu buon sawm ahi amah?” a ci hi. Kumpipa in tua bang a gen behin amate in zong puon tawh Haman’ mai a khu pai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua ciengin kumpipa’ nasem numeite a uh cilgesa pasalte lahah Harbona kici pa in, “En in, ama’ kammal tawh kumpipa a na suohta sah ngai ahi Mordecai a khailia nadingin Haman in tong sawmnga a sang khuom a bawl pen Haman inn ah kiphut lai hi,” a ci hi. Kumpipa in, “Tua tungah Haman khailia un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuaci’n ama in Mordecai khailia nadinga a na bawl khuom tungah Haman a khailia uhi. Tua ciengin kumpipa’ lungthahna a veng hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Khum ni-in Kumpipa Ahasuerus in Kumpinu Esther tungah Jew-te’ galpa Haman’ neisa zosie a pie hi; tuale Esther in Mordecai koi ahei ci kumpipa kungah a gensa ahi ziehin kumpipa mai-ah Mordecai a pei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tua ciengin kumpipa in Haman kung pana a lah ahi suoikaina khutsip sutin Moredecai a pie hi. Tuaci’n Esther in Haman’ inn sunga a vaihawm dingin Mordecai a koi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua ciengin Esther in kumpipa a hopikia hi; a keng bulah a kaa kawmin tua nu khupbawh a, Agag-te Haman’ gitlo vaihawmna le Jew-te kitha nadinga a sawmdapna thute a kidawkia nadingin a thum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kumpipa in Esther lamah a kham ciengkhut a zamsah phei a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />tuale Esther tho-in kumpipa mai-ah a ding hi. Ama nu in, “Kumpipa’ lung lam su kha-in, a maipha ka nga a, kumpipa mai-ah thuman ahi a, ama’ lungkimna ka nga leh, kumpi gamkhen zosie-a om Jew-te kitha nading a sawm Agag-te Hammedatha’ tapa Haman’ thupiehna lai kihawmte a kidawkia thei nadingin thupiehna lai khat gielsahkia in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Azieh pen keima in ka mite tunga a tung tuosietna ka mu ding bangci thuoh ding ka hei?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua ciengin Kumpipa Ahasuerus in Kumpinu Esther le Jew-te Mordecai kungah, “En vawi, Haman’ neisa zosie Esther ka pie zo a, amate in sing tungah ama khailia zo uhi, azieh pen ama in Jew-te tha a sawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kumpipa’ min tawh a kigiel thukip lai, kumpipa’ suoikaina khutsip tawh a kitumsa lai pen kidawh thei ta lo ahi ziehin, Jew-te tawh kisai-in hoi na sah bangin kumpipa’ min tawh lai giel inlen, kumpipa’ suoikaina khutsip tawh tum in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Sivan hla a kici a hla thumna a ni sawmni le thum ni-in kumpipa’ thuvanpite kihlan a, Mordecai’ thupieh zosie tawh kituohin Jew-te le India panin Ethiopia dong gam zakhat le sawmni le sagi a uh kumpipa’ vaisaite, gamkhen uhte, le miliente tungah lai kihawmkia a, a gamkhen cietah amau’ lai le amau’ minam cietah amau’ ham ciet tawh kigiel a, Jew-te tungah zong amau’ lai le amau’ ham ma tawh kigiel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ama in Kumpipa Ahasuerus’ min tawh laite gielin kumpipa’ suoikaina khutsip tawh tuate tum a, kumpipa adinga a kikhawi kumpi sakol buh sunga sakol hatte tungah amate tuongsahin lai kitaisah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hla sawm le nina ahi Adar hla a ni sawm le thumna ni khat sungin Kumpi Ahasuerus’ uhna gamkhen sung khuo zosie-a om Jew-te kikhawmin a hinna uh a kihundawh nading, minam khat’ galkapte ahi sihle gamkhen a sim dingte pen a numei a naupangin susie a, thatgamin a suhmang nading ule a neisate a tomgam nadingun tami laihawmna tawh kumpipa in Jew-te tungah bawl theina thu a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Gamkhen zosie-ah a kiteisawn thukhenna lai khat ciet kihawmin mi zosie kitheisah a, Jew-te ahile tua ni-in a galte tungah phu la dinga kigingkhol ding uh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuaci’n kumpipa’ sakol hatte tungah laitaite tuongin kumpipa’ thupieh bangin a nawtai uhi. Kumpi khuo ahi Susa khuopi sungah tua thukhenna lai kihawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua ciengin Mordecai in kumpi puon a dum le a kang silin kham tawh a kibawl kumpi lukhu golpi khat khu a, saihadiel puonnel le puon sandup silsa-in kumpipa opna panin pusuoh a, tua laitahin Susa khuopi sunga om mi zosie lungdam kipahin a awng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile Jew-te adingin lungdamna, kipahna le patawina a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kumpipa’ thukhenna le a thupieh a tunna gamkhen zosie le khuopi zosie sunga a om Jew-te lahah lungdamna le kipahna, pawite le zumkha ni a om hi. Tua banah khum gama mi tampite in Jew-te a giin ziehun Jew mi ka hi hi, a kici uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kumpipa’ thupieh le a thukhenna a kisep ding kuon laitah, amate tungah Jew-te’ galte guol zo dinga a kinep ni uh, hizongle thu kikhelin Jew-te in a galte tunga a guolzaw ni ding uh, a hla sawm le nina Adar hla a ni sawm le thum ni-in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />a siet nading uh a suite a susie dingin Kumpipa Ahasuerus’ uhna gamkhen zosie-a om amau’ khuopite-ah Jew-te a kikhawm uhi. Mi zosie in Jew-te a giin ziehun koima in amate nang zo lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amate in Mordecai a giin ziehun gamkhen zosie sunga miliente, kumpipa’ vaisaite, le gamkhen uhte in Jew-te a panpi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile Mordecai in kumpi’ inn sungah thu nei mama a, a thuneina khang semsem ahi ziehin gamkhen zosie-ah a minthanna kizel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuaci’n Jew-te in namsau tawh a galte zosie uh that a, amate a mudate tungah dei bangin a bawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kumpi khuo Susa khuopi sungah Jew-te in mi zanga thatin susie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amate in Parshandatha, Dalphon, Aspatha,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Poratha, Adalia, Aridatha,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Parmashta, Arisai, Aridai, Vaizatha,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Jew-te’ gal ahi Hammedatha’ tapa Haman’ tapa sawmte that uhi; ahi vangin amate in ama’ vante a thamkha sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Khum ni mama-in kumpipa tungah kumpi khuo Susa khuopi sunga a kithat mi phaza kizasah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kumpipa in Kumpinu Esther kungah, “Kumpi khuo Susa khuopi sungah Jew-te in mi zanga a that zo ta vua, Haman’ tapa sawmte zong that zo uhi. Kumpipa’ uhna adang gamkhen tengah bang teng khat a bawl ta ding vuoi? Tu-in bang na ngen nuom lai ei? Na nget popo ang kipie ding hi. Bang nget be nuom lai na hei? Na nget popo ang kipie ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Esther in, “Kumpipa in hoi na sah leh, tuni-a thukhenna tawh kizui-in zing ciengin zong Susa khupi sunga om Jew-te tungah bawl thei nading phalna pie inlen, Haman’ tapa sawmte sing khuom tungah khailiasah in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuaci’n kumpipa in tua banga a kibawl nadingin thu pie a, Susa khuopi sungah thukhenna kibawlin Haman’ tapa sawmte a kikhailia sieng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Adar hla a ni sawm le li ni-in Susa khuopi sunga om Jew-te a kikhawmkia vua, Susa khuopi sungah mi zathum that uhi. Hizongle amate in van a thamkha sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tu-in a hinna uh hu dingin kumpipa’ uhna gamkhen teng sunga om Jew-te zong kikhawmin a galte’ khut sung panin suotahna a nga vua, amate a muda mihing tul sawmsagi le tulnga that uhi. Ahi vangin amate in vante tungah a khut a ngam sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tam banga a bawlna uh pen Adar hla a ni sawm le thum ni hi a, a ni sawm le li ni-in a tawlnga vua, khum ni pen pawi bawlni le lungdam ni a hisah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ahi vangin ni sawm le thum ni le ni sawm le li ni-in Susa khuopi sunga om Jew-te kikhawmin, ni sawm le ngana ni-in a tawlnga vua, khum ni pen pawi bawl ni le lungdam ni ahisah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin khuoneute le kulpi a nei lo khuopite sunga a teng Jew-te in Adar hla a ni sawm le li ni pen pawi bawlna le khatlekhat an kithahna ni-in a zang uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Mordecai in tam thu teng lai-in ciemte a, Kumpipa Ahasueras’ uhna a nai a gamla-a om gamkhen zosie sunga Jew-te zosie tungah lai a hlah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A kumkumin Adar hla ni sawm le li ni le sawm le nga ni pen amate in a tan nadingun thu pie a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />tua nite-in amau’ galte panin Jew-te a suotah ni uh ahi a, tua hla pen amate dingin dana panin lungdamna, tauna le thumna panin tawlngah ni khatin a kikhelna hla ahi sah hi. Tuaci’n amate in khum ni tegel pawibawl ni le lungdam ni a suohsah vua, amate in khatlekhat an kithahna ni le mizawngte tunga letsong pieh ni-in a nei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuaci’n Mordecai in amate kunga lai a na giel bangin amate in a na patsa uh tam banga a bawlnate uh Jew-te in ngaina khatin a zang uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Jew-te zosie’ galpa ahi Hammeda-tha’ tapa, Agag-te Haman in Jew-te suhmang ding na sawm a, ama in amate gawtin a suhmang nadingin Pur kici ai a san hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ahi vangin kumpipa’ mai-ah Esther a tun ciengin, Jew-te suhsiet nadinga a gitlo sawmna teng pen ama’ lu tungah a tuh nading, le sing khuom tungah ama le a tate a kikhailia nadingin kumpipa in lai gielin thu a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin tam nite Pur kammal panin Purim na kici ahi hi. Tua ahi ciengin amate in tami laihlah sunga kigiel thute zosie, le tam thute a mit utawh mu-in a pumpi utawh a tuona uh ziehin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Jew-te in amate, a suon a hlahte ule amate a pawm mite in tam ni nite gel pen ngaina khatin sangin, lai sunga kigiel bangin kumsiela a kise hunin a pel loin a tan nadingun a kipsah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />A khangkhangin innkuon sim, gamkhen sim, khuopi simah tam nite kiphawhin kitang ding hi; tuale Jew-te lahah tami Purim nite pen tan lo thei lo hi ding a, a suonlehlahte uh lahah tam nite phawna pawi a bawl zing ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Abigail’ tanu Kumpinu Esther in Jew-te Mordecai tawh a bukim thuneina tawh a giel uh tami Purim tungtang thu a niveina laihlah pen a kipsah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ahasuerus’ kumpi gama gamkhen za le sawmni le sagi sunga om Jew-te zosie tungah kilemna le lungmuonna a op nading deisahna laite kihlah a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Jew-te Mordecai le Kumpinu Esther in Jew-te tunga a kipsah uh ma bangin a kisesa amau’ hunin tami Purim nite a kitan nadingin thu kipie hi. Tua ma bangin amate le a suon a hlahte adingin antan nading le thumna nei nading tawh kisai ngainate a giel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Kumpinu Esther’ thupiehna in tam Purim tawh kisai zui ding ngainate kipsah a, tam thute lai sungah kiciemte hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kumpipa Ahasuerus in a uhna gam sung le tuipi tunga om tuikul gamte tungah sieh kai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama’ vanglietna le a sepnate zosie, le Mordecai tunga a pieh minphatnate, Media le Persia Kumpite’ Khang Tangthu Laibu sungah kigiel hi lo amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Azieh pen Kumpipa Ahasuerus’ zomah Mordecai a zalien pen ahi a, tuale ama in a mite’ hoi nading sui a, a suonlehlahte zosie’ nopsah nading a thumpieh ziehin Jew-te lahah ama in thu nei a, a unaute lahah zong a minthang hi.
  </para>
</usx>
